WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.001
[elevator dings]

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.088
Lucifer.

00:00:06.465 --> 00:00:08.675
Maze. Just in time.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.513
Detective, would you like to
go out with me this evening?

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:15.349 position:67%
[Chloe] After I saw your face, I felt lost.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.309
I just wanna get back to work.

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:19.102
The detective is clearly in denial.

00:00:19.186 --> 00:00:20.020
Help me.

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:21.772
Take it slowly.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.899
How is Lucifer?

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.235
I'm sure he is just fine.

00:00:26.318 --> 00:00:27.653
[music playing]

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:31.031
Yeah.

00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:38.830
Hey, Luc.

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:40.290
Eve?

00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:42.042
Long time no see.

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:44.795
[music continues playing]

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:47.714
Who are you?

00:00:47.798 --> 00:00:48.632
I'm Eve.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:49.633
As in Adam and Eve?

00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:54.346
Lucifer's bringing his girlfriend
on cases now, huh?

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:55.847
She's actually really sweet.

00:00:56.098 --> 00:00:59.142
I don't think that you understand
the dangers of having Eve here.

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:02.479 position:56%
When the Devil finds his first love,
evil shall be released.

00:01:02.563 --> 00:01:03.689
Eve is amazing.

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:05.816
She appreciates that I'm the Devil.

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:07.526
I'm guessing this won't end well.

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:08.652
[both laugh]

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:11.738
Could you accept who I truly am?

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:13.448
[screams]

00:01:13.657 --> 00:01:14.783
I don't know.

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:17.077
You don't have to change.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.412
You're already perfect.

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:25.460
This is not who you are.

00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:26.378
I'm the Devil.

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:27.337
[music continues playing]

00:01:34.595 --> 00:01:36.888
This is going to be so much fun.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:44.313
[music ends]

